    "sections": [
      {
        "label": "Verse 1",
        "lines": [
          {
            "en": "Midnight, I don’t kill the lights when I arrive",
            "es": "Medianoche, no apago las luces cuando llego"
          },
          {
            "en": "Windows down, let them watch us as we drive",
            "es": "Ventanas abajo, que nos miren mientras conducimos"
          },
          {
            "en": "Like it matters what they say",
            "es": "Como si importara lo que digan"
          },
          {
            "en": "Between the fire and paradise",
            "es": "Entre el fuego y el paraíso"
          },
          {
            "en": "we always end up in the same place",
            "es": "siempre terminamos en el mismo lugar"
          },
          {
            "en": "You never let me slip away",
            "es": "Nunca dejas que me aleje"
          },
          {
            "en": "And even when you know the end",
            "es": "E incluso cuando conoces el final"
          },
          {
            "en": "you never really tell me no",
            "es": "nunca me dices realmente que no"
          },
          {
            "en": "We fall right back where we began",
            "es": "Volvemos a caer justo donde empezamos"
          },
          {
            "en": "again and again we go",
            "es": "una y otra vez, volvemos"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
