          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "Verse 2",
        "lines": [
          {
            "en": "What can I say when your eyes pull me in",
            "es": "¿Qué puedo decir cuando tus ojos me atraen?"
          },
          {
            "en": "Every time I try to leave I fall again",
